cff-version: 1.2.0
title: linkml-data-gen
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "BU Neuromics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/BU-Neuromics/linkml-data-gen"
abstract: >-
  Generate realistic, stochastic, schema-valid test data from any LinkML schema.
  Driven by linkml-runtime's SchemaView, it produces connected, referentially
  consistent datasets for testing, demos, and fixtures, with configurable
  sampling distributions, domain hints, and schema-scope selection.
keywords:
  - linkml
  - test-data
  - synthetic-data
  - fixtures
  - schema
  - bioinformatics
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-06-26"
